{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00764","headline":"郊庙歌辞 襃德庙乐章 武舞作 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 襃德庙乐章 武舞作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昭昭竹殿开，奕奕兰宫啓。\n懿范隆丹掖，殊荣辟朱邸。\n六佾荐徽容，三簋陈芳醴。\n万石覃贻厥，分珪崇祖祢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00764.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00764","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}